# Pad 11: New synth, Syn 4.
input 140800 pad-hit 10 100
input 142400 pad-release 10
input 144000 press ok
input 145600 release ok
input 147200 press down
input 148800 release down
input 150400 press down
input 152000 release down
input 153600 press ok
input 155200 release ok
# T2: the hit on its empty pad 4 selects it, and New synth puts Syn 5 there only. Back on T4, the
